        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-6682, 18\" Hampton Collection Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 18 Inch Hampton Door Handle is trending in the design world for its versatile look. The transitional appeal is perfect for home remodels, straddling modern decor with traditional styles for something that looks sleek and warm at the same time. The 18 Inch Hampton Collection Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on almost any door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/hampton-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-681\"><b>Matching Hampton Cabinet Pull</b></a>and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-hampton-door-handle-rk-international-ph-6681\"><b>12 Inch Hampton Collection Door Pull</b></a> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hampton Collection Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "18 Inch Hampton Door Handle",
                "description": "The 18 Inch Hampton Door Handle is trending in the design world for its versatile look. The transitional appeal is perfect for home remodels, straddling modern decor with traditional styles for something that looks sleek and warm at the same time. The 18 Inch Hampton Collection Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on almost any door.",
